# No environment variables are currently required to build or run this app.
#
# This project has no backend, API, or Firebase integration — chapter
# summaries are bundled locally as Markdown files under assets/summaries/.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder so that if environment-based
# configuration (API keys, feature flags, etc.) is introduced later,
# contributors have a documented place to declare the required variables.
#
# Example (uncomment and fill in when needed):
# API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
# API_KEY=your_api_key_here
